        "| cleanflate | 412 MB/s |",
        "\"c_zlib_median_ns\": 1234567,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "no-cleanflate-checksums-in-fixtures",
      "description": "C16: cleanflate unit-test fixtures never compute a trailer/header checksum with this crate's own crate::checksum -- a broken encoder would satisfy a broken decoder. Every checksum embedded in a fixture is a literal computed once with oracle::ffi::{crc32,adler32}, or the test lives in crates/oracle/tests/ instead.",
      "paths": [
        "crates/cleanflate/src/tests/"
      ],
      "exclude": [
        "crates/cleanflate/src/tests/checksum.rs"
      ],
      "pattern": "\\bcrate::checksum\\b",
